{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 523 days after the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D10"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Cefotetan is not on FDA's current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; FDA's history shows an earlier shortage first posted on 2014-08-14, since resolved.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 955350 at ACS Dobfar S.p.A. (FEI 3006028606) ended 2016-01-19 and was classified OAI with 14 observations on laboratory controls and written procedures.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 523 days after FDA posted the shortage on 2014-08-14.",
      "cites": ["D10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to the same plant on 2017-01-13.",
      "cites": ["E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our Corvale Lakeside and Corvale East sites both use NDC 63323038510 labeled by Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC and manufactured at ACS DOBFAR SPA (FEI 3006028606 and 3002807084).",
      "cites": ["E6", "E2", "E17", "E23"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 9.5 days on hand at 4.1 vials per day; Corvale Lakeside has 26.9 days on hand at 0.9 vials per day.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option is to transfer 11 vials of 1 g/10 mL from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would leave Lakeside with 15 days and bring East to 12 days.",
      "cites": ["D13"]
    }
  ]
}
